Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:03.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:06.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:09.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The bond that joins us will never break
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:12.67,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,and its light will shine on the end of our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:15.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Wake up! Wake up! Wake up heart beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:18.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are the one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:28.07,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Freedom is our only compass we need. -We are best friends-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:28.07,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(761.37,497.833)}Translation & initial timing\N{\fs26.667}Yibis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:34.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll be the ones to carve out our own route.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:32.16,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632.179,277.5)}Timing\N{\fs26.667}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:39.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We spend all our days moving full speed ahead, -Go east, Go west-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:37.60,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(261.469,394)}Quality-checking\N{\fs26.667}Sewil\NGalaxy 9000\NHalee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.64,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(787.075,400)}Soundtracking\N{\fs26.667}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:45.41,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,each day brings something new and we leave nothing unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.56,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,526)}Video editing\N{\fs26.667}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.56,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,385)}Raw provider\N{\fs26.667}GS-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:51.20,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Every trial we overcome brings a chance for thrills. (I can't stay)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:56.05,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow and each day after will be heated, intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:59.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,A chain of excitements!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right! Shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:05.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Trust your curiosity, follow your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:10.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,and head for your goal, that's what adventure is all about!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:13.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's go shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:16.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread open the chart of your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:19.17,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,There's power hidden in the bond between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.29,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,it'll help us grasp the end of our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Never! Never! Never! Never stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:30.16,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are the one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:35.47,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(1049.5,100)\fad(400,0)}王宮地下一樓\N（外牆塔）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.21,0:01:40.78,Title,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}大話王騙人蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.99,0:01:49.66,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,到處都是死路。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.66,0:01:55.23,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,都說了，皮卡完全掌控著這座石造城堡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:03.14,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,草帽，他真的沒問題嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:05.22,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嗯？索隆？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.91,0:02:08.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你不用擔心他。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:10.58,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不管發生什麼，索隆都不會有事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:14.78,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(1082.15,100)\fad(224,634)}同一樓層——\N索隆 對 皮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.95,0:02:20.72,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他還是毫髮無傷。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:23.44,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這傢伙就是不肯罷休！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:25.16,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我到底該怎麼攻擊他？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:27.66,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(790,100)\fad(224,0)}王宮\N一樓——\N士兵與\N矮人們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:31.10,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,隊長！又來了一個幹部！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:37.37,Main,Ranpo,0,0,0,,那是皮卡軍的古拉迪斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:39.77,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,以你們現在的狀態根本沒有勝算。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:42.84,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,蘭波和我來拖住他。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:44.21,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,趁他分心的時候繼續前進！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:47.88,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,住手！你們打算犧牲自己嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:48.88,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,蘭波！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.52,Main,Ranpo,0,0,0,,從兩側夾攻吧，喀布君！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:52.50,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:54.45,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:03:00.76,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,為什麼我得跟這些老鼠打？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:06.27,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,喀布！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:08.53,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,蘭波！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:35.49,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,我知道玩具沒那麼快。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:44.84,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,我是吃了破破果實的破裂能力者。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:51.58,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,我能讓自己的身體破裂……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:53.05,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,還有……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.48,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,任何我碰到的無機物質。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:04.06,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,把你這種鐵皮玩具炸得粉碎，簡直易如反掌！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:06.56,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:08.39,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我一定要……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:13.80,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,完成我的任務！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:19.07,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,蕾貝卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:22.51,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,破裂去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:26.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}噴射印章！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:33.55,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,士兵，佛朗基他們在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:39.89,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.89,0:04:41.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼，他們沒跟你在一起？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:44.06,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,草帽，我們沒時間閒聊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:46.30,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,草帽魯夫？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:48.30,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,薇歐蕾特？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:50.88,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,你竟敢……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:55.51,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,你竟敢背叛少主！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:56.94,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,放馬過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:58.24,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,不，快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:03.05,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,沒時間了。而且，他極度危險。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:06.35,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,我們得趕快前往二樓的西裝廳！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:08.69,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,薇歐蕾特大人，您怎麼會在這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:10.39,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,你認識我？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:13.76,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,是的，雖然你不記得我。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:17.83,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,我一直用透視能力看著你。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:19.93,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,你和蕾貝卡都是。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:23.07,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,你一定很辛苦吧。謝謝你。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.41,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,薇歐蕾特！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:30.04,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,你這背叛的女人……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.18,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:35.85,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,我沒有背叛任何人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:41.25,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,這十年來，我從未站在你們那一邊過！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:44.02,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,即便如此，你也羞辱了少主！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:46.49,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}頭盔穿刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:54.80,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,薇歐蕾特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:55.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:00.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，你不會有事的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.07,0:06:01.51,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,抱歉，我應該保護你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我只要繼續前進就行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:04.58,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:06.28,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,樓梯不在這個方向！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:12.35,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.45,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,你要去哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:14.82,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,是上面吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.16,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,他們去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:29.03,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,少主？您在這裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:33.74,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(901,0)}錦右衛門喬裝的\N唐吉訶德·多佛拉衛門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:31.64,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,2,,「少主」？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:33.74,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,2,,我乃唐吉{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:36.18,Main,Wicca,0,0,0,,他們都稱多佛朗明哥為「少主」！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.24,0:06:39.08,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我就是少主。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:41.71,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,宮中有入侵者。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:44.42,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,在我們處理掉他們之前，請您在樓上等候。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:47.19,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,不，那可不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:49.56,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,這裡就交給你們處理。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:52.76,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我得下去查看勘十郎的情況。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:55.89,Main,Gladius,0,0,0,,那個從廢料場消失的武士？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.10,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.33,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,他消失了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:04.10,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,2,,太、太厲害了！我們就在目標的正前方！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:04.10,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(467,0)}王宮二樓\N西裝廳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:06.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們為什麼要躲起來？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:07.54,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,明哥就在那邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:09.44,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,安靜點。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:12.28,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,你會毀了他們的整個行動。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.38,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,行動？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:21.22,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,我還以為你們只是衝著SMILE工廠來的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.82,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:28.46,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,那為什麼草帽一夥和格林比特的矮人會聯手？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:32.70,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,那可不是你們某天心血來潮就能結成的同盟。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:34.93,Main,Law,0,0,0,,矮人？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:38.50,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,他們是怎麼到地下的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:46.28,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,他們為什麼要對付砂糖？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:50.25,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,他們這些舉動到底是什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:54.65,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,這些麻煩事一件接一件堆疊起來。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:08:00.39,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,除非這是巧合，否則他們……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:07.63,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,一定知道這個王國陰暗的根源。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:16.91,Main,Baby 5,0,0,0,,回答！少主問你話了，羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:24.05,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,別打他打到讓他哭出來 -{\i1}達斯呀{\i0}。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:25.88,Main,Buffalo,0,0,0,,你還是老樣子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:26.72,Main,Baby 5,0,0,0,,不過……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:28.05,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我不是說過了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:33.46,Main,Law,0,0,0,,他們現在已經跟我無關了。\N我們的同盟已經破裂。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:37.96,Main,Law,0,0,0,,你說的東西我大半都聽不懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:53.91,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,要是薇歐蕾特能來幫忙審問就好了。她能立刻讓你吐出真相。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:55.68,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,還是說……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:09:00.32,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,這該不會是你搞的鬼吧，利克國王？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:04.19,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,頓達塔族以前也侍奉過你。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:09.84,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,父親，您在宮裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:11.96,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,小羅還活著。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:17.30,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,利克國王！過了這麼多年還能看到您平安無事，真是太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:23.21,Flashbacks,Riku,0,0,0,,你叫居魯士？跟我來。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:26.98,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我發誓一定會救你出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.78,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,雷奧他們還沒好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:37.72,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,等我和德雷斯羅薩其他的玩具變回人類……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:40.36,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,那將是我殺掉多佛朗明哥的唯一機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.94,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我{\i1}一定{\i0}要殺了他！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.70,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我不能讓喀布和蘭波的犧牲白費！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:49.17,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,就靠你們了，雷奧和騙人蘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:54.61,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(600,0)}玩具屋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:56.34,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,放棄吧，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:58.14,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,別再抵抗，快投降！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:00.25,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,閉嘴。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:03.75,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,給我閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:14.73,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我已經決定要來場毫無意義的大鬧了，你們給我做好覺悟。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:24.27,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,要是我帶著這些傢伙追著跑到地下，只會礙著矮人們。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:28.04,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,SOP作戰就交給你們了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.11,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,放馬過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.22,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,這些傢伙由我來對付。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.98,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,就靠你了，騙人蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:41.89,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(1059.99,100)\fs38}{\fad(367,0)}地下貿易港——\N幹部之塔遺跡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.22,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那邊到底是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:41.85,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,好像有入侵者。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:45.82,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不過我們有托雷波爾大人在。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:50.06,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我雖然替他們感到惋惜，但他們根本不是他的對手。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:59.47,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,他們卻一直爬起來。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:08.51,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,我一時大意，被變成了玩具。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.05,0:11:12.65,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,那就表示，大家一定都把我忘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.19,0:11:14.55,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,騙人布……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:16.96,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,騙人布在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:18.96,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,你辦得到的，騙人布。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:21.33,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,只剩下你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:24.56,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,把我變回人類。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:30.17,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,他們拚了命想讓我吃下這東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.90,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,八成是毒藥。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:34.34,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,好臭。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:38.81,Thoughts,Leo,0,0,0,,我、我們什麼都做不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:43.68,Flashbacks,Usopp,0,0,0,,別擔心！要是出了什麼差錯，我一定會救你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:46.18,Thoughts,Leo,0,0,0,,騙人蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.45,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:49.19,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你要去哪，老兄？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:52.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好，我成功逃脫了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.82,0:11:55.03,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,原諒我，頓達塔族。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:58.43,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,騙人布，你在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:12:03.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好，我會把你們的英勇事蹟寫進\N流傳後世的繪本裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:06.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,「輕信的頓達塔族」。這標題不錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:08.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我一定要活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.57,0:12:11.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,再說，這全都是佛朗基的錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他為什麼不來幫忙？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:17.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我才不要為了假扮英雄而送命呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:23.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,既然逃出來了，我該怎麼離開這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:28.69,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我一個人沒辦法從進來的那個洞出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.69,0:12:31.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等等，他們說有個港口。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:34.03,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，外面的各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:39.00,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂喂，你們在工作嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.57,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,這可不是什麼表演，你們這些混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:43.60,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.31,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,回去工作！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:48.15,Secondary,Pirate,0,0,0,,繼續搬那些貨箱！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.65,0:12:49.18,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,別杵在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:51.98,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,給我快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:56.12,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,有人在對抗唐吉訶德家族嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:59.86,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,我變成玩具已經八年了，這還是頭一遭。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:03.03,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,不管是誰都好，拜託把這地方摧毀吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:07.67,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,表演？！我已經看夠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.50,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,那些傢伙要怎麼處理？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:18.54,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂喂，這些傢伙是不是在說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:21.15,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,騙……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:22.04,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,……人……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.04,0:13:23.32,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,……蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:26.69,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,……蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:29.59,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,騙人蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:32.76,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,騙人蘭……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:36.43,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,騙人蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:39.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡，升降機在哪？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:42.27,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,騙人蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:45.70,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,騙人蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:49.24,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,騙人蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:50.98,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,騙人蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:54.78,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,那是他之前說過的名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:08.06,Main,Toy,0,0,0,,騙人蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:14:00.79,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,{\i1}騙人蘭……騙人蘭……騙人蘭……{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.15,0:13:57.32,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,騙……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:01.95,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,騙人蘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:11.30,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡，別叫我的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:17.60,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,騙人蘭？喂，那是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:20.81,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,都說了，是矮人們剛才說的那個名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:22.74,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,你這白痴，快去死吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:26.04,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,我才不會死呢，你這臭小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:34.55,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,騙人蘭是我們的英雄。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:38.39,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,英、英、英雄？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:41.89,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,那他會來救你們大家嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.89,0:14:43.88,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:46.10,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,而且不只是我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:52.07,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,騙人蘭說他會拯救我們所有人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:57.78,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,那些在這下面被迫每天工作的玩具。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.28,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,他說的是我們嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:05.28,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,還有在工廠裡拚命勞動的夥伴們。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:13.79,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,那些走在鎮上看似開朗、內心卻在哭泣的玩具。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:20.10,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,還有那些沒察覺自己失去了珍愛之人的可憐大人類。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:23.97,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,騙人蘭會拯救我們所有人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:27.31,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他是傳說中的英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:34.95,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,我才不要假扮什麼英雄呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.65,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,真可憐。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:39.82,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,他從頭到尾都在騙人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:44.49,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,你們是不是又被騙了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:46.19,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,你說的是真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:53.10,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,你們都快死了，他卻還沒現身。這就是最好的證據。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:55.70,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,英雄在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:57.60,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,怎樣？在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:01.21,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,可是他說會救我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:05.91,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,他八成正在某個地方笑你們有多蠢呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:11.78,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,你們也太容易相信別人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:14.85,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,而且，如果這不是你們自己編出來的夢，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:18.72,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,{\fs42}他真的說過會救大家，那他也是那種\N遇到危險就落跑的傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:20.73,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,把所有希望都丟掉吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:23.53,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,雖然不想承認，但他說的大致沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:26.20,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,你們也快逃吧。祝你們好運。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:28.20,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,不、不可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:37.24,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:40.45,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,騙人蘭絕不會說謊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.06,0:16:55.49,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,騙人蘭是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:59.24,Flashbacks,Usopp,0,0,0,,我是諾蘭德的後代！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:01.87,Flashbacks,Gnomes,0,0,0,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:08.54,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,無論如何，騙人蘭一定會救我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:11.24,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他就是這麼跟我們說的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.25,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:15.48,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:16.71,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:17.92,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:18.82,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:25.72,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,{\i1}沒錯！沒錯！沒錯！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:29.83,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,他答應過我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:33.40,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,英雄絕不會欺騙我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:40.17,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,要是你再詆毀騙人蘭的名字，\N你會後悔的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.11,0:17:44.58,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,你們最好做好覺悟。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:48.95,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,等騙人蘭來了，你們就別想{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:56.92,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,多好笑的慘叫。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:59.59,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,頓達塔族的死前哀嚎還真是好笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.99,0:18:02.23,Main,Bobomba,0,0,0,,雷奧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:05.56,Main,Inhel,0,0,0,,沒錯。就像雷奧說的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:09.00,Main,Inhel,0,0,0,,騙人蘭會完成SOP作戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:13.94,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:17.58,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,該覺得可憐的是你們，不是我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:24.48,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,那就快點把你們的{\i1}英雄{\i0}叫來啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:27.69,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,他怎麼能這麼殘忍？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:33.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,住手，別說了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:39.03,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,夠了，別再說了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:45.70,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,騙人蘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:48.41,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,{\i1}騙人蘭！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:49.97,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.97,0:18:50.98,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:58.48,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你們這些笨矮人到底要相信我到什麼時候啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:03.39,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,就像他說的，那全都是謊言。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:10.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我不是什麼傳說英雄，騙人蘭也不是我的名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:18.37,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我是草帽海賊團的狙擊手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:20.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我的名字是騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:23.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我是海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.17,0:19:25.52,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,草、草帽海賊團？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:27.28,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,他們為什麼會在這下面？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:37.02,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,為什麼……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:41.33,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,你為什麼要那樣說？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:50.20,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,你或許是海賊，但你依然是英雄，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:52.37,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我說了，不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.37,0:19:54.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,海賊就是海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:58.44,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別逼我一直重複！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:01.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我一直在騙你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:05.12,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,而你們卻一直相信我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:20.83,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,所以你大老遠跑來，就只是為了說那是謊言？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:26.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,要是我不說，這些傢伙會一直等到死。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:29.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,要是那樣的話，我這輩子都無法原諒自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:34.08,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,既然他們這麼堅持相信我，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:40.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那我就只好帥氣地賭上性命去救他們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:45.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我的名字是騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:47.89,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,給我記清楚了，頓達塔族！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:54.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果我死了，就在諾蘭德的雕像旁邊為我立一座！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:59.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我就要成為你們傳說中的英雄了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:05.08,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:08.31,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,草帽海賊團的騙人布。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:12.32,Thoughts,Toy,0,0,0,,他會是拯救我們的人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.49,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,多麼不顧一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:19.22,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,孤注一擲了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:24.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺綠星：法國梧桐……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.17,0:21:28.23,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}……手裏劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:42.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼樣，你這怪物？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.81,0:21:50.49,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我是傳說英雄，草帽海賊團的狙擊手，騙人布船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.49,0:21:52.72,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,{\i1}騙人蘭！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:54.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:56.26,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,{\i1}騙人蘭！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我說了是騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:04.10,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,{\i1}傳說英雄，騙人蘭！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:09.01,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,320)\fad(533,0)}王宮二樓\N西裝廳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.77,0:22:08.54,Main,Grunt,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}據報您人在一樓，少主。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.98,0:22:14.85,Main,Doflamingo,0,0,0,,那是什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.85,0:22:16.48,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,利克國王……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.52,0:22:20.42,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,這是把好劍。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:23.82,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,要是我變回人類，就用這把。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.82,0:22:27.73,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,我父親今天在鬥技場比過賽。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.73,0:22:29.73,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.73,0:22:33.80,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,當他得知多佛朗明哥退位的消息有誤時，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.07,0:22:38.47,Main,Violet,0,0,0,,他就跟我們其他人一樣，再也忍不下去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.97,0:22:42.44,Thoughts,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,利克國王在鬥技場？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.81,0:22:47.68,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,有個少年殺人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:51.92,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,貧民窟裡的一場鬥毆死了兩個人！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:07.47,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(1769,0)}貧民窟的少年\N居魯士（十五歲）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.84,0:23:11.94,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,陛下！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:14.47,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,您在做什麼，陛下？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.47,0:23:15.47,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,太危險了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.47,0:23:20.11,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,他雖然是個孩子，但惡名早已傳遍全國！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.48,0:23:26.68,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,陛下有危險！射殺那少年！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:28.65,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,不，別開槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.65,0:23:29.75,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,放下武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.52,0:23:32.22,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,可、可是，大人……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:39.18,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,聽說你一個人對抗數十名敵人。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.18,0:23:45.27,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,其中半數以上都受了傷，還有兩個……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.27,0:23:49.77,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,他們殺了我最好的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.77,0:23:52.14,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,我只是在討回公道！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:55.28,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,你是野獸嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.28,0:24:00.02,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,隨你怎麼叫！\N你們這些王族什麼都不懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.02,0:24:03.55,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,他是這世上我唯一能信任的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.26,0:24:06.99,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,他就像我的兄弟一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.93,0:24:10.93,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,你叫居魯士，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:13.60,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,跟我來。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.17,0:24:19.50,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,十五歲的殺人犯，居魯士！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.34,0:24:25.31,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(1004.53,100)\fad(1768,0)}鬥牛鬥技場
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.50,0:24:22.72,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,他的對手是身經百戰的老練鬥劍士！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.72,0:24:25.33,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,這裡可是神聖的鬥技場！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.65,0:24:34.39,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,多驚人的天賦！要是那刀刃夠鋒利，他的對手早就當場斃命了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.39,0:24:38.19,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,外面稱之為「殘暴」，在這裡卻叫「天賦」，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.79,0:24:42.30,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,他輕輕鬆鬆就把同牢的獄友打得半死。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:47.10,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,他已經六天沒進食，不停高喊著要我們把你叫來。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.10,0:24:50.60,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,你找我做什麼，利克國王？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.60,0:24:55.04,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,利克國王說，只要你能贏得一百場戰鬥，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.04,0:24:58.54,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,他就赦免你。\N無論要花多少年都無所謂。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.64,0:25:01.88,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(1235,0)}四個月後
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.68,0:25:07.59,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,居魯士終於達成了一百戰一百勝！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.59,0:25:14.23,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,他讓我們最大牌的明星都相形見絀！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:17.30,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,別再出來了，殺人犯！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:21.17,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,你不肯離開？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.17,0:25:24.00,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,我不會去我不被需要的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.27,0:25:28.84,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,你什麼時候開始在乎有沒有被需要了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.84,0:25:30.11,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.88,0:25:36.15,Thoughts,Kyros,0,0,0,,野獸……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.28,0:25:39.02,Thoughts,Kyros,0,0,0,,只有在牢籠裡……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.02,0:25:41.39,Thoughts,Kyros,0,0,0,,才會被人賞識！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.19,0:25:48.29,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,兩百勝！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.29,0:25:50.32,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,誰來，打倒居魯士！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.32,0:25:52.03,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,把他撂倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.07,0:25:57.30,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,三百勝！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:26:02.31,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,無人能阻擋居魯士！\N英雄們一個個倒在他面前！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.21,0:26:08.66,Main,Announcer,0,0,2,,終於……終於……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.11,0:26:12.38,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(668,252)}在鬥技場的\N第四年
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.66,0:26:10.41,Main,Announcer,0,0,2,,他成為史上第一個……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.41,0:26:12.82,Main,Announcer,0,0,2,,連勝一千場的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.82,0:26:14.42,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,{\i1}居魯士大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:16.32,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,衝啊，居魯士！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.90,0:26:26.33,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,你又來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.33,0:26:27.50,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,退後！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.03,0:26:31.04,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,你們怎麼可能懂？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.50,0:26:37.91,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,不管我做什麼，\N我永遠都會是殺人犯和野獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.55,0:26:42.93,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,難道……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.93,0:26:45.28,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,就沒有……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.28,0:26:48.39,Main,Kyros,0,0,0,,能讓他們忘記我的辦法嗎？
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,WAKE UP! [2015-03-01]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,/WAKE UP!

